WEBVTT

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:43.730
Long live the people, the emperor, and the army. Long live the people.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:46.470
The black wolf is coming. Hurry up.

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:47.450
Hurry up.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:48.460
Go now.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:54.530
Go now.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:55.530
All of you, go back.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:56.830
Yes.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.600
Now I will explain the relationship between the oil tank and the internal combustion engine.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:09.960
In terms of design, the internal combustion engine will first extract the fuel from the fuel pump and then mix it with the air

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:13.720
and then it will enter the combustion chamber in the internal combustion engine to be burned.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:15.430
Everyone, write it down.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.690
What do you want to do?

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.230
Don't stand there! Get out of here!

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:45.270
Why are you guys making a scene here?

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:48.150
This school is not for rent!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.520
Get out of here!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:57.360
What?

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:01.260
You guys are too much!

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.800
Get out of my way!

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.940
What do you think you're doing?

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:09.760
You're just here to bully people.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.410
Who are you?

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:13.230
How dare you talk to me like that?

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.850
Don't think I'm afraid of you.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.200
I just don't want to see you

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.350
in the eyes of Mr. Shantian.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:23.210
Listen.

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:24.900
I don't care who you are now.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.210
Get out of my sight.

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.720
I'll count to three.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.100
You get out of my sight!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.000
You!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:34.460
One, two, three, four.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:39.600
Two, three, four.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.000
This is the seat of the Black Dragon Society.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.830
I don't want to fight anymore.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.830
You guys are fighting so fast.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.910
Master.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.910
Didn't I say that martial arts can't solve problems?

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:41.020
Is there anyone who still has doubts?

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:44.210
Professor Du Bian, on behalf of them, I apologize to you.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:52.290
Come on.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.470
Master.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:56.510
You have to thank them for being kind.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.520
Or else you will become a cripple.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.000
Come on.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.880
Who did you fight with?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.040
I did.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:07.060
Who are you?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.200
You have good kung fu.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.830
I'm the missionary of the Black Dragon Society.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:12.980
You are...

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:18.960
You...

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.340
Guang Zi, why are you here too?

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.840
Uncle Transition.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:24.130
My steel brush

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:25.930
was broken by your apprentice.

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.580
You must pay me a new one.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:28.220
Guang Zi,

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.000
don't you know that your Uncle Transition

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.000
He's famous for being a poor light bulb.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:36.430
Who has money?

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.330
It's enough for you to buy a new pen.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.290
You little girl.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:46.140
You know how to travel with you from day to night.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.120
When you grow up in the future, you can't get married.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.120
It's none of your business.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.120
As long as I have Chen Zhen.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.300
Hello.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.540
I'm Chen Zhen from Jingwu School.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:56.540
Jingwu School in Shanghai?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.400
Yes.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.830
What about Mr. Huo Yuanjia?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.000
Mr. Huo Yuanjia.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.710
is my master.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.860
Really?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.480
You don't believe it?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.090
No.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.150
I just received a telegram

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:15.170
from Shanghai, China.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.760
The telegram said

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.040
Mr. Huo Yuanjia

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.880
was killed in a contest.

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:25.120
The opponent is our Black Dragon Society.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.760
His name is Jay Chuan Longyi.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:31.580
It's impossible.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.470
I'm sorry.

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:36.980
I'm telling the truth.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:38.030
I'm sorry.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.420
I'll leave first.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:53.820
It's a pity that I don't have the chance to talk to you.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:57.310
Chen Zhen.

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:58.570
Chen Zhen.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:00.000
Where are you going?

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.800
Zhonghua Hall, I want to check if master is really dead.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:07.050
Your master can't be killed by the Japanese, he definitely won't.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:10.670
Long live the emperor!

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:14.980
Long live the emperor!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.680
I will tell you, if you go there for a long time and come back, I will never wait for you.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:48.340
Chen Zhen, will you come back?

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:54.400
When they leave China and go back to Japan, I will come back to find you.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.000
But the Japanese are fighting the Germans in Qingdao.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.000
You have to figure it out.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:02.240
Qingdao is also the territory of China.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:05.030
The Japanese and Germans are both invaders.

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:09.970
Zhenzhen, do you really hate the Japanese so much?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.210
I don't know.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:16.790
Guang Zi, God is in this era.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.150
You and I can't choose.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.460
Please take care.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:30.580
Thank you.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.450
I really don't have any money.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.000
Did I say I don't have any money?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.980
Go away, go away, go away

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.680
And

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:34.920
I am not Japanese

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.160
Sir, so you are not Japanese

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.180
That's great

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.940
Please sit

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:41.820
Sir, where are you going?

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:43.150
I am going to the Golden Pagoda

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.260
Golden Pagoda?

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.520
Are you going to learn Kungfu?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.940
Uncle, I am going to learn Kungfu

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.020
Please hurry up

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.010
Learn Kungfu?

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:52.890
I advise you not to go to the Golden Pagoda

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.730
In Shanghai, everyone knows that

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:56.410
The Golden Pagoda used to be the first

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.930
Now it is this

00:09:58.930 --> 00:09:59.700
Are you pulling it or not?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.320
If you don't pull me, I'll change another car.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.080
Pull, pull, pull.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:05.400
You give me the money, I'll go wherever you say.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.440
Sit tight.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:11.720
Let's go.

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:29.640
Even Huo Yuanjia is dead.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.110
There's no future for Golden Martial Arts School.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.160
Hey, think about it.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.680
I'll introduce another martial arts school to you.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.620
There's no future for it here.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.490
Brother Wu.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:41.610
Brother Wu, it's really you.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.320
A'Biao, I'll help you take it.

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:45.060
Thank you.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:46.130
You are...

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:48.830
Chen Zhen, Golden Martial Arts School.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.280
There must be a future for Golden Martial Arts School.

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:55.540
Wait and see.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:59.230
What's wrong? What are you waiting for?

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.000
Brother Wu.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.530
Master Wu.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:13.280
Master Ni.

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.270
This is the ancestral hall.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:16.400
If you want to learn martial arts,

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.570
please go outside.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:16.000
Oh my god!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.820
Master Ni, pardon me

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:20.830
Brother Huo, it's my fault

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.500
It's my fault

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.300
You have traveled a long way from such a far place

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.300
If you have the chance to cut me off next time

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.840
Why don't I visit you at the court?

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:37.680
I've finished my book.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:46.180
No matter what, I'll be fine once I come back.

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.920
Uncle Nong.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.960
I didn't want to delay your graduation.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.710
So I told them not to inform you.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:55.300
How did you know?

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.400
I only knew it when I saw the newspaper in Japan.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.330
The Japanese must be very proud of him now.

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:16.840
Chen Zhen, go and bow to your father first.

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.020
Hey, what are you doing?

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.180
Chen Zhen is not from the Huo family.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:24.260
How can you treat him with respect?

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.640
Uncle Long, Chen Zhen grew up with his father.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.050
His father raised him up.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:29.920
There is no difference between him and the Huo family.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:40.020
Before father went to the martial arts academy,

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:42.520
his asthma was already very serious.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.950
I tried to persuade him a few times,

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:49.490
but he just didn't listen.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:52.760
Cut your hair.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.780
It's written by your master.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:27.070
Uncle Long, Chen Zhen is right.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.450
Foreigners are at the core of our land.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.000
It's because

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.530
We've been enduring for too long.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.840
I told you.

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.800
I, Huo Jing'en, will save us in the future.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.120
I won't endure it anymore.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:57.080
I'll go find Jie Chuan.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:57.880
Chen Zhen.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.760
According to the rules, you have to write a challenge first.

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.760
I'll go now.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:03.100
I don't care what rules he has.

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:05.490
Chen Zhen.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:07.910
Hongkou Dao is a place for the Japanese.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:09.860
We can't do anything to them.

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:10.950
What if something happens to you?

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.770
What about us?

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.450
Even your father is not their opponent.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.820
Uncle Long.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:17.280
Your father gave you to me.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:20.410
I have this responsibility to take care of you.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.500
A'Long, A'xiang.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.980
You take a few brothers and follow Chen Zhen.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.450
If anything happens, come back and inform me immediately.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.140
Yes.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:28.860
Sang Wan.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:29.490
Yes.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.000
Where is the phone?

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:30.970
It's so nice here.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:32.710
It's so beautiful.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:35.470
Let's go out.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:36.390
Mr. Lao.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.340
Your phone.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:40.240
Who is calling at this time?

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:42.350
Hello, what can I do for you?

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.680
Long Jingsun.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:49.090
It's such a big deal.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.950
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.110
Follow me to Hongkou Bazaar.

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:53.110
Yes.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:00.840
What are you doing?

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:01.880
Use your strength.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:02.720
Use my strength.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:06.850
Rest for a while.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:22.170
Why are you here?

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:24.530
I'm Chen Zhen from the Jinwu Sect.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.750
I'm looking for Long Yi from the Xie Sect.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.960
You are not allowed to enter Hong Kong.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.640
This is the place for Chinese people.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:34.750
Chinese people can come in if they want to.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:35.280
Bastard!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.740
I don't want to fight with you.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:23.300
Tell your supervisor to come out.

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:35.260
I want to have a fair competition with Chen Zhen.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:39.250
If there is any consequence,

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.950
both sides can't pursue it.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:57.890
My master uses the Huo family's power.

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:00.000
I also use the Huo family's power to fight with you.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.520
is my master's opponent.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:31.020
Yes, it is.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:31.920
It's true.

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:47.750
I've told you before.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.030
Other than the Japanese,

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:49.630
there's no sign of you.

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:50.590
You can't go in.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:51.670
Yes.

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:54.300
Did you see it clearly?

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.420
Did he go in?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.230
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.990
Yes, we saw it.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:00.000
Look, Wu Xiumi came out.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.000
You're not Japanese, are you?

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:04.440
No.

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:06.340
You're not Japanese, are you?

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:40.640
What's the matter?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.560
Nothing.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.960
Mr. Teng Tian, Mr. Lin Shi.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:45.590
Nothing.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:46.950
It's really nothing.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.320
It's better not to make trouble.

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:50.360
Yes.

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:56.210
Team B, team B.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.480
Wu Shisheng, how is it going?

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:04.290
We won.

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:08.320
Go inform Uncle Ting'an and Uncle Nong.

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:09.600
Go to Master's grave to find me.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:10.240
Let's go, Anlu.

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:11.760
Master Huo's tomb hasn't been set up yet.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:30.000
Doctor.

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:31.070
I'll trouble you.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:51.350
I'm a doctor, not a magistrate.

00:22:51.350 --> 00:22:53.800
Let me do it.

00:22:53.800 --> 00:22:55.640
Which department are you going to?

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:57.840
If you want to check the poison, take the liver out.

00:23:00.860 --> 00:23:03.420
What are you doing?

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:04.580
What is the doctor doing here?

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:05.890
Opening the coffin

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:07.390
Why didn't you stop him?

00:23:07.390 --> 00:23:08.350
Brother Long

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:09.890
Chen Zhen is from the Jinwu sect

00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:11.770
I have no right to stop him

00:23:11.770 --> 00:23:12.600
But you

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:13.670
Chen Zhen

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:15.560
How can you touch the body of my father?

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:16.970
I have fought with Jie Chuan

00:23:16.970 --> 00:23:19.280
He is not the opponent of my master

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:21.580
I suspect that my master was poisoned

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:22.650
Xie Yun Kui

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:24.760
You don't suspect that Mr. Huo is poisoned, do you?

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:26.660
Huo Yuanjia was beaten by Jie Chuan

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:28.320
A lot of people saw it

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:29.410
That's right

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:30.000
Do you think we

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:31.380
Everyone is blinded.

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:35.140
Uncle Nong,

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:37.870
I would rather be sad and disloyal to my master,

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:40.530
than to find out the truth.

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:41.980
If you want to stop me,

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:43.060
then kill me first.

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:45.170
Stop.

00:24:07.360 --> 00:24:10.080
I'm sure he died of the poison in the noon.

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:14.730
Who poisoned him?

00:24:14.730 --> 00:24:17.000
I'll leave this question to you.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.190
Come, let's help.

00:24:19.190 --> 00:24:20.560
Let's bury the master.

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:21.930
- Yes. - Yes.

00:24:21.930 --> 00:24:28.300
Master, it won't be so easy for him to be killed by the Japanese.

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:30.000
That's right. It must be the Japanese.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.760
Little Japan wouldn't dare to do magic in the future.

00:24:31.760 --> 00:24:33.560
Yes. Fortunately, my brother came back at the right time.

00:24:33.560 --> 00:24:38.990
If it wasn't for him, we wouldn't have known.

00:24:38.990 --> 00:24:40.130
I can't figure it out.

00:24:40.130 --> 00:24:42.120
Why would Master be poisoned?

00:24:42.120 --> 00:24:43.600
Master has so many hobbies outside.

00:24:43.600 --> 00:24:45.580
It's easy for him to be poisoned.

00:24:45.580 --> 00:24:46.640
Do you still remember?

00:24:46.640 --> 00:24:47.800
Master spent a month of time in Jin Yang

00:24:47.800 --> 00:24:49.160
to compete with Jie Chuan.

00:24:49.160 --> 00:24:50.580
He didn't have any hobbies outside.

00:24:50.580 --> 00:24:52.180
That's right.

00:24:52.180 --> 00:24:58.620
The one who poisoned him must be the inner deity of Jin Wu Sect.

00:24:58.620 --> 00:25:00.000
Xiao Hui.

00:25:00.090 --> 00:25:03.270
Teacher, are you in charge of the food system?

00:25:03.270 --> 00:25:06.500
Yes, what is it?

00:25:06.500 --> 00:25:09.460
Uncle Long Da, are you suspecting Xiao Hui?

00:25:09.460 --> 00:25:13.200
No, I mean, besides Xiao Hui,

00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:15.840
who else will take care of your father's food?

00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:17.610
It's me!

00:25:17.610 --> 00:25:20.640
Everything that Jin Wu Men eats is through me.

00:25:20.640 --> 00:25:22.910
Are you suspecting me?

00:25:22.910 --> 00:25:26.660
Ah Xiang, go to the kitchen and see if there is any poison or rat poison.

00:25:26.660 --> 00:25:27.620
Go and see.

00:25:27.620 --> 00:25:29.270
Uncle Geng, don't be so angry.

00:25:29.270 --> 00:25:30.000
It's none of your business.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:35.120
Go to the kitchen and see if there is anything that can poison the dead.

00:25:35.120 --> 00:25:37.200
Hurry and go!

00:25:37.200 --> 00:25:39.200
Uncle Geng, don't be so impulsive.

00:25:39.200 --> 00:25:42.170
If you don't investigate, I will die.

00:25:42.170 --> 00:25:44.530
What is it, Eldest Senior Brother?

00:25:44.530 --> 00:25:47.510
Uncle Nong is investigating who is the murderer of Die.

00:25:47.510 --> 00:25:49.430
Uncle Geng thinks we suspect him.

00:25:49.430 --> 00:25:51.510
I didn't suspect him.

00:25:51.510 --> 00:25:53.370
That's fine.

00:25:53.370 --> 00:25:55.420
You don't want to eat the food you cooked for me.

00:25:55.420 --> 00:25:57.340
I've been here for so many years.

00:25:57.340 --> 00:25:59.340
Huo Ye grew up eating the food I cooked for him.

00:26:00.600 --> 00:26:02.760
Nong Jingsun, you said I was poisoned.

00:26:02.760 --> 00:26:04.120
You said I poisoned Huo Yan.

00:26:04.120 --> 00:26:04.880
I...

00:26:04.880 --> 00:26:07.040
Okay, Uncle Geng, let's eat.

00:26:07.040 --> 00:26:10.330
Chenchen, was the food poisoned?

00:26:10.330 --> 00:26:12.440
Master was eating with us.

00:26:12.440 --> 00:26:14.430
If your food poisoned Master,

00:26:14.430 --> 00:26:16.670
everyone would be poisoned.

00:26:16.670 --> 00:26:18.270
Your analysis makes sense.

00:26:18.270 --> 00:26:20.500
Nong Jingsun, did you hear that?

00:26:20.500 --> 00:26:21.170
Suspecting.

00:26:21.170 --> 00:26:22.330
Sit.

00:26:22.330 --> 00:26:23.970
Uncle Geng, let's eat.

00:26:23.970 --> 00:26:24.970
By the way,

00:26:24.970 --> 00:26:27.050
those Japanese may come back to trouble us.

00:26:27.050 --> 00:26:28.010
Let's eat quickly.

00:26:28.010 --> 00:26:29.380
Let's eat.

00:26:33.230 --> 00:26:36.850
Senior, I want to go to Smith's place.

00:26:36.850 --> 00:26:38.230
He will tell me the results of the test.

00:26:38.230 --> 00:26:40.670
Let's see what poison Master has been poisoned with.

00:26:40.670 --> 00:26:42.350
Test?

00:26:42.350 --> 00:26:45.150
Yes, a chemical test.

00:26:45.150 --> 00:26:53.640
Oh.

00:26:53.640 --> 00:26:58.040
No, no.

00:27:12.440 --> 00:27:13.690
You're not that good.

00:27:13.690 --> 00:27:18.040
You're not that good.

00:27:18.880 --> 00:27:20.800
Brother Wu, I've never seen you practice like this before.

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:21.840
Do you still want to teach us boxing?

00:27:21.840 --> 00:27:22.480
Yes.

00:27:22.480 --> 00:27:23.640
Come on, let's practice.

00:27:23.640 --> 00:27:25.360
Come on, teach us boxing.

00:27:25.360 --> 00:27:26.240
Let's go.

00:27:44.080 --> 00:27:46.510
If the movements are too tricky, it might not be effective.

00:27:46.510 --> 00:27:49.070
If you learn kung fu, you can't practice to death.

00:27:49.070 --> 00:27:51.080
There is only one purpose for fighting.

00:27:51.080 --> 00:27:52.290
It is to guide the opponent.

00:27:52.290 --> 00:27:55.310
So I will definitely ask for the speed and strength of the reaction.

00:27:55.310 --> 00:27:59.630
And the simplest attack is also the most direct and effective.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:02.850
If you want to fight, you first have to learn how to fight.

00:28:02.850 --> 00:28:04.010
No, Senior Wu.

00:28:04.010 --> 00:28:05.890
Before the enemy stops, you have to knock down the enemy first.

00:28:05.890 --> 00:28:07.450
But if you don't have enough strength,

00:28:07.450 --> 00:28:09.900
if you hit him ten times, the enemy will be fine.

00:28:09.900 --> 00:28:13.150
If he hits you once, you will fall down and can't hold on.

00:28:13.150 --> 00:28:15.810
Senior, these two people want to learn Kung Fu.

00:28:15.810 --> 00:28:17.970
May I ask if Master Chen Zhen is teaching us Kung Fu?

00:28:17.970 --> 00:28:19.730
Yes, we want to learn Kung Fu from Master Chen.

00:28:19.730 --> 00:28:21.930
Our master today is Huo Ting'an.

00:28:21.930 --> 00:28:23.330
Is it because Cheng'an doesn't dare to guarantee?

00:28:23.330 --> 00:28:26.250
If you don't want to learn, just go back.

00:28:26.250 --> 00:28:27.490
What kind of horse is this?

00:28:27.490 --> 00:28:28.450
It's a four-wheeled horse.

00:28:28.450 --> 00:28:29.440
A four-wheeled horse?

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.130
I think it's a dead horse.

00:28:31.130 --> 00:28:32.650
Kick it, let me see.

00:28:34.950 --> 00:28:36.190
How can you kick it like this?

00:28:36.190 --> 00:28:37.160
Let me tell you.

00:28:37.160 --> 00:28:38.460
In Japanese martial arts,

00:28:38.460 --> 00:28:39.660
there is a kind of side kick.

00:28:39.660 --> 00:28:40.860
Although it's very simple,

00:28:40.860 --> 00:28:43.010
it's fast and powerful.

00:28:43.010 --> 00:28:44.550
Senior Wu, kick it for us.

00:28:44.550 --> 00:28:45.350
Yes.

00:28:45.350 --> 00:28:46.150
Come on, hurry up.

00:28:46.150 --> 00:28:47.710
Senior Wu, kick it for us.

00:28:47.710 --> 00:28:49.250
Come on, hurry up.

00:28:49.250 --> 00:28:51.030
Come on, stand up.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:01.380
Are you alright?

00:29:01.380 --> 00:29:03.360
You have to use all your strength

00:29:03.360 --> 00:29:16.820
to kick it out at the right time.

00:29:16.820 --> 00:29:26.000
Don't leave.

00:29:26.000 --> 00:29:27.920
It's too late.

00:29:27.920 --> 00:29:29.510
I want you to stay.

00:29:31.150 --> 00:29:33.080
I'm the owner now, so I have to go back.

00:29:33.740 --> 00:29:35.020
Your father was here before.

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:36.480
You don't dare to stay outside.

00:29:36.720 --> 00:29:37.960
Now that you're the owner,

00:29:37.960 --> 00:29:39.080
what's there to be afraid of?

00:29:41.030 --> 00:29:42.160
What if someone sees me?

00:29:42.520 --> 00:29:44.210
In the future, someone will disobey me.

00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:46.720
I don't believe

00:29:46.840 --> 00:29:48.820
there is anyone who dares to disobey me.

00:29:49.760 --> 00:29:50.660
Okay?

00:29:50.780 --> 00:29:54.160
Stay here.

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:56.080
I must leave before dawn.

00:30:02.750 --> 00:30:06.800
I'm very dissatisfied with your performance.

00:30:06.800 --> 00:30:09.510
There are only a few of you who bought the Chinese martial arts academy.

00:30:09.510 --> 00:30:12.810
The relationship between the Black Dragon Society and the Chinese is not very close.

00:30:12.810 --> 00:30:15.800
The Qingdao of the Japanese army is not returned to China.

00:30:15.800 --> 00:30:18.980
There is no way to make the Chinese feel good about the Japanese.

00:30:18.980 --> 00:30:21.850
Qingdao is the Japanese army.

00:30:21.850 --> 00:30:24.450
They took it from the Germans with their blood.

00:30:24.450 --> 00:30:25.860
If the Chinese want to take back Qingdao,

00:30:25.860 --> 00:30:27.650
they have to exchange it with blood.

00:30:27.650 --> 00:30:29.090
Do you understand?

00:30:29.090 --> 00:30:30.000
Chengtian.

00:30:38.000 --> 00:30:41.710
I want to know the movements of these people.

00:30:41.710 --> 00:30:50.290
I want to see the Japanese.

00:30:50.290 --> 00:30:51.130
In this world,

00:30:51.130 --> 00:30:53.040
there are always some fools who don't know how to eat.

00:31:00.480 --> 00:31:03.890
I'm sorry, I'm late.

00:31:03.890 --> 00:31:06.920
Mr.Jie Chuan, Chen Zhen scared you.

00:31:06.920 --> 00:31:08.800
You don't even know how to knock the door.

00:31:08.800 --> 00:31:10.280
I want you to rest more.

00:31:10.280 --> 00:31:12.400
I'm not ready to let you attend this meeting.

00:31:15.250 --> 00:31:20.890
I just want to ask you one thing.

00:31:20.890 --> 00:31:23.180
Our military commissioner,

00:31:23.180 --> 00:31:27.140
have you heard about the fire of Yuanjia?

00:31:27.140 --> 00:31:28.750
You guys go out first.

00:31:28.750 --> 00:31:29.480
Yes.

00:31:35.050 --> 00:31:36.360
How is it?

00:31:36.360 --> 00:31:38.360
Is there anything that can't be said publicly?

00:31:38.360 --> 00:31:39.380
Huh?

00:31:39.380 --> 00:31:45.450
Did you ask someone to do the poisoning?

00:31:45.450 --> 00:31:47.240
The Great Japanese Empire

00:31:47.240 --> 00:31:55.370
has surpassed China in both economy, technology, industry, and military power to this day.

00:31:55.370 --> 00:31:57.730
I originally hoped that those of you who learn martial arts

00:31:57.730 --> 00:32:00.000
would be able to break the martial arts myth of China.

00:32:00.730 --> 00:32:03.880
It's a pity that you don't appreciate it.

00:32:03.880 --> 00:32:06.950
We had no choice but to interfere.

00:32:06.950 --> 00:32:09.090
Useless!

00:32:09.090 --> 00:32:11.430
So, you don't want to accept it?

00:32:13.320 --> 00:32:15.460
This is just for you soldiers.

00:32:15.460 --> 00:32:17.770
It's not suitable for people who practice martial arts.

00:32:17.770 --> 00:32:21.550
My competition with Huo Yuanjia

00:32:21.550 --> 00:32:23.780
was supposed to be real.

00:32:23.780 --> 00:32:27.550
It's just that I made such a bad person like you.

00:32:27.550 --> 00:32:30.000
You don't deserve to talk about the spirit of a warrior.

00:32:32.010 --> 00:32:34.250
I'll show you the spirit of a warrior.

00:32:34.250 --> 00:32:43.690
Just forget about right and wrong.

00:32:43.690 --> 00:32:46.120
In order to serve the Emperor,

00:32:46.120 --> 00:32:48.150
even if you're a criminal of history,

00:32:48.150 --> 00:32:50.150
you won't be able to do it again.

00:32:50.150 --> 00:32:52.790
Hey, that's not right.

00:32:52.790 --> 00:32:54.900
Let me show you.

00:32:54.900 --> 00:32:56.900
We said he kicked like this.

00:32:56.900 --> 00:32:58.750
The conclusion of Dr. Smith's examination

00:32:58.750 --> 00:33:00.000
is that the master should do it like this.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.860
He should have given a slow poison

00:33:01.860 --> 00:33:04.950
to destroy his lung function.

00:33:04.950 --> 00:33:07.170
When he was fighting with Jie Chuan,

00:33:07.170 --> 00:33:11.480
he couldn't stand his gravity at all.

00:33:11.480 --> 00:33:18.190
There must have been a traitor in our Jingwu Sect.

00:33:18.190 --> 00:33:20.540
Chen Zhen, why did you come back?

00:33:21.100 --> 00:33:23.910
Uncle Nong, why do you ask me this?

00:33:24.800 --> 00:33:26.720
After you came back these two days,

00:33:26.720 --> 00:33:28.250
all the brothers and sisters

00:33:28.250 --> 00:33:30.000
regard you as someone they admire.

00:33:34.890 --> 00:33:37.080
But have you ever thought

00:33:37.080 --> 00:33:38.700
how painful it is for Ting'en?

00:33:38.700 --> 00:33:40.650
How is that possible?

00:33:40.650 --> 00:33:42.090
From the first day you came back

00:33:42.090 --> 00:33:43.680
everything you did

00:33:43.680 --> 00:33:45.080
was based on your own decision.

00:33:45.080 --> 00:33:47.830
Have you ever asked Ting'en?

00:33:47.830 --> 00:33:52.290
You didn't take her into your eyes.

00:33:52.290 --> 00:33:54.140
You are very capable.

00:33:54.140 --> 00:33:55.920
But you have to remember

00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:58.200
that Ting'en is the only supervisor of our Jinwu School.

00:34:02.910 --> 00:34:05.030
It's late, you should go to bed early.

00:34:05.030 --> 00:34:19.180
Senior Wu, you're so early to go jogging?

00:34:19.180 --> 00:34:29.960
You're really good at kung fu.

00:34:30.510 --> 00:34:32.510
Look, all our brothers are here.

00:34:32.510 --> 00:34:34.510
They want to learn kung fu from you.

00:34:34.510 --> 00:34:36.510
You teach me how to learn kung fu.

00:34:36.510 --> 00:34:45.080
What kung fu do you want to learn?

00:34:45.080 --> 00:34:52.590
Is it kung fu?

00:34:52.590 --> 00:34:53.140
Yes.

00:35:03.360 --> 00:35:05.240
Wait, don't go.

00:35:05.240 --> 00:35:06.320
You can't use violence to solve the problem.

00:35:06.700 --> 00:35:08.710
Officer.

00:35:30.640 --> 00:35:31.440
Good morning, Chief.

00:35:37.580 --> 00:35:38.460
Where did you go yesterday?

00:35:38.460 --> 00:35:39.440
You didn't come back all night.

00:35:41.920 --> 00:35:43.160
Where is Chen Zhen?

00:35:43.850 --> 00:35:44.810
He went out for a run.

00:35:46.950 --> 00:35:48.050
Wait for him to come back and tell me.

00:35:48.610 --> 00:35:49.400
I'll go back to my room first.

00:36:00.120 --> 00:36:01.000
We can't wait any longer.

00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:02.390
The Japanese are coming.

00:36:02.390 --> 00:36:03.620
Everyone, come out.

00:36:03.620 --> 00:36:06.020
Brother Han.

00:36:06.020 --> 00:36:06.910
The Japanese are coming.

00:36:06.910 --> 00:36:09.080
Calm down.

00:36:09.080 --> 00:36:12.970
I think something bad is going to happen.

00:36:12.970 --> 00:36:13.970
Hurry and go to the police station to report.

00:36:13.970 --> 00:36:14.850
Okay.

00:36:20.450 --> 00:36:21.530
What's the matter?

00:36:21.530 --> 00:36:22.450
Chen Zhen.

00:36:22.450 --> 00:36:23.360
Where is he?

00:36:23.360 --> 00:36:25.000
Chen Zhen?

00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:26.620
I don't know.

00:36:26.620 --> 00:36:28.960
Maybe he went to beat the Japanese.

00:36:28.960 --> 00:36:30.000
My junior has a very bad temper.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:32.560
It's strange that you don't fight the Japanese all day long.

00:36:32.560 --> 00:36:33.880
You don't feel well at all.

00:36:33.880 --> 00:36:35.700
Stop it.

00:36:35.700 --> 00:36:37.580
The Chinese are so despicable.

00:36:37.580 --> 00:36:41.040
They assassinated us and took control of us.

00:36:41.040 --> 00:36:43.230
The Japanese are the Japanese.

00:36:43.230 --> 00:36:44.770
They only know how to accuse the bad guys first.

00:36:44.770 --> 00:36:46.010
Stop talking nonsense.

00:36:46.010 --> 00:36:48.400
If you don't give me Chen Zhen today,

00:36:48.400 --> 00:36:49.700
I won't leave.

00:36:49.700 --> 00:36:51.480
You came prepared this time.

00:36:51.480 --> 00:36:52.890
I don't think you will leave either.

00:36:53.490 --> 00:36:54.420
Close the door.

00:36:59.330 --> 00:37:00.000
Close the door.

00:38:40.360 --> 00:38:42.360
If not, I will marry you.

00:38:49.820 --> 00:38:58.420
Got it.

00:39:02.080 --> 00:39:03.620
Okay, you can leave now.

00:39:03.620 --> 00:39:04.650
What did you say?

00:39:04.650 --> 00:39:06.130
Just let them go like this?

00:39:06.130 --> 00:39:07.840
Everyone is injured.

00:39:07.840 --> 00:39:08.890
I think we should let them go.

00:39:08.890 --> 00:39:10.540
We won't leave.

00:39:10.540 --> 00:39:12.060
Hand over Chen Zhen.

00:39:12.060 --> 00:39:14.220
Brother Du, give me some face.

00:39:15.590 --> 00:39:17.550
I don't know what face is.

00:39:17.550 --> 00:39:20.620
Chen Zhen.

00:39:24.660 --> 00:39:25.220
Don't move.

00:39:25.220 --> 00:39:26.220
Don't move.

00:39:27.760 --> 00:39:29.510
Old man.

00:39:30.060 --> 00:39:31.970
I don't believe that you dare to shoot me.

00:39:31.970 --> 00:39:33.470
I don't dare to shoot,

00:39:33.470 --> 00:39:36.490
but I don't know if this gun will be set on fire.

00:39:36.490 --> 00:39:38.200
Whoever moves, I will shoot.

00:39:38.200 --> 00:39:39.270
Take Chen Zhen away.

00:39:39.270 --> 00:39:39.950
Yes.

00:39:39.950 --> 00:39:40.670
Wait.

00:39:40.670 --> 00:39:41.850
Why do you want to take Chen Zhen away?

00:39:41.850 --> 00:39:43.390
Jie Chen was killed yesterday.

00:39:43.390 --> 00:39:44.700
I will take him back for investigation.

00:39:45.180 --> 00:39:46.110
I didn't kill anyone.

00:39:46.110 --> 00:39:46.470
I didn't...

00:39:46.470 --> 00:39:47.190
Take him away.

00:39:47.190 --> 00:39:49.350
Go.

00:39:49.350 --> 00:39:50.790
Go away.

00:39:50.790 --> 00:39:52.150
Don't make trouble.

00:40:12.990 --> 00:40:13.590
Sit down.

00:40:14.290 --> 00:40:16.880
Don't worry.

00:40:17.090 --> 00:40:18.410
Xie Liaojie is in charge of this case.

00:40:18.410 --> 00:40:19.450
He said it's all right.

00:40:22.910 --> 00:40:24.680
Why are you dressed like this?

00:40:24.860 --> 00:40:25.790
I'm sorry.

00:40:26.430 --> 00:40:28.460
Brother Long, I can't protect myself now.

00:40:28.880 --> 00:40:30.000
I'm not in charge of this case.

00:40:30.350 --> 00:40:31.270
Where is Chen Zhen?

00:40:32.160 --> 00:40:33.160
It depends on luck.

00:40:33.160 --> 00:40:34.160
It depends on luck.

00:40:34.160 --> 00:40:41.730
Heiting.

00:40:41.730 --> 00:40:44.930
Chief Xing.

00:40:45.840 --> 00:40:47.950
You said there were four witnesses?

00:40:47.950 --> 00:40:50.470
Yes.

00:40:50.470 --> 00:40:52.470
There are four witnesses in our interrogation room.

00:40:52.470 --> 00:40:54.470
They can all prove that Chen Zhen killed someone.

00:40:55.500 --> 00:40:56.640
It's really strange.

00:40:56.640 --> 00:40:58.640
Where did they find these four witnesses?

00:40:58.640 --> 00:41:00.000
I saw them with my own eyes.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:02.790
I saw them stab each other

00:41:02.790 --> 00:41:05.950
It's him

00:41:05.950 --> 00:41:08.770
I saw him stab the Japanese with a axe

00:41:08.770 --> 00:41:11.380
I really saw it

00:41:11.380 --> 00:41:14.420
Excuse me, how many fingers do I have here?

00:41:14.420 --> 00:41:18.400
Two

00:41:18.400 --> 00:41:20.640
No, no, four

00:41:20.640 --> 00:41:22.640
You scared me

00:41:22.640 --> 00:41:25.840
Why don't you walk over there and let me see it clearly

00:41:25.840 --> 00:41:27.840
No, it's just nonsense

00:41:27.840 --> 00:41:29.220
They found him

00:41:32.490 --> 00:41:34.010
I didn't kill anyone.

00:41:34.010 --> 00:41:35.880
I was at Jingwu Gate at that time.

00:41:35.880 --> 00:41:37.830
My fellow brothers can testify for me.

00:41:37.830 --> 00:41:38.850
Your honor,

00:41:38.850 --> 00:41:39.890
I think the people of Jingwu Gate

00:41:39.890 --> 00:41:41.550
are brothers of the same sect with Chen Zhen.

00:41:41.550 --> 00:41:43.470
So they don't have the right to testify.

00:41:43.470 --> 00:41:44.230
Don't talk nonsense.

00:41:44.230 --> 00:41:45.580
Don't talk nonsense.

00:41:45.580 --> 00:41:46.780
Order! Order!

00:41:46.780 --> 00:41:48.230
It's true. It's true.

00:41:48.230 --> 00:41:52.620
You're looking for a witness, aren't you?

00:41:52.620 --> 00:41:53.880
Your honor,

00:41:53.880 --> 00:41:56.390
I have a most powerful witness.

00:41:56.390 --> 00:41:56.990
Your honor,

00:41:56.990 --> 00:41:59.680
I think the statements of the Chinese are not enough.

00:41:59.680 --> 00:42:00.000
My witness

00:42:00.120 --> 00:42:07.150
I'm Japanese.

00:42:07.150 --> 00:42:30.000
Okay.

00:42:30.920 --> 00:42:33.130
My name is Shan Tian Guang Zi.

00:42:33.130 --> 00:42:35.170
The current Minister of Education, Shan Tian Guang Nan,

00:42:35.170 --> 00:42:36.810
is my father.

00:42:36.810 --> 00:42:38.480
According to Chen Zhen,

00:42:38.480 --> 00:42:40.490
he stayed at Jing Wu Men all night.

00:42:40.490 --> 00:42:41.490
Miss Shan Tian,

00:42:41.490 --> 00:42:43.290
can you prove this?

00:42:43.290 --> 00:42:46.700
Chen Zhen lied.

00:42:46.700 --> 00:42:50.180
That night,

00:42:50.180 --> 00:42:52.580
he and I were in the hotel room.

00:42:52.580 --> 00:42:54.370
We never went out.

00:42:54.370 --> 00:42:56.400
All night?

00:42:56.400 --> 00:42:57.300
Yes.

00:43:05.400 --> 00:43:09.890
You wouldn't know if Chen Zhen sneaked out after she woke up.

00:43:09.890 --> 00:43:11.750
But she didn't have a chance to go out.

00:43:11.750 --> 00:43:16.820
That night, the two of us didn't sleep on the bed.

00:43:16.820 --> 00:43:18.820
Since you didn't sleep, then what were you doing?

00:43:18.820 --> 00:43:23.690
The two of us didn't sleep on the bed.

00:43:23.690 --> 00:43:25.830
What do you think we were doing?

00:43:28.360 --> 00:43:30.000
What is she saying? I don't know.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:32.280
That Japanese woman said she slept with my brother.

00:43:32.280 --> 00:43:33.280
Really?

00:43:33.280 --> 00:43:34.200
Shameless.

00:43:34.200 --> 00:43:35.300
Yeah, that's right.

00:43:37.300 --> 00:43:42.350
This case is ridiculous.

00:43:42.350 --> 00:43:45.040
I now announce that this case is closed.

00:43:45.040 --> 00:43:47.020
The defendant is not guilty.

00:43:47.020 --> 00:43:48.960
Congratulations.

00:43:55.850 --> 00:43:57.860
What kind of national hero is he?

00:43:57.860 --> 00:44:00.000
He's just an arrogant person.

00:44:00.800 --> 00:44:10.480
Why are you here?

00:44:10.480 --> 00:44:13.110
I have already abandoned everything.

00:44:13.110 --> 00:44:15.350
You will take care of me for the rest of your life.

00:44:15.350 --> 00:44:29.620
I will cook for him.

00:44:30.440 --> 00:44:31.760
You should be dead!

00:44:31.760 --> 00:44:36.060
Chen Zhen, your master sent you to Japan before he died.

00:44:36.060 --> 00:44:37.920
He wanted you to learn new technology in Japan,

00:44:37.920 --> 00:44:40.480
learn to deal with those Japanese people.

00:44:40.480 --> 00:44:42.920
Don't forget what your master told you

00:44:42.920 --> 00:44:44.600
for a Japanese woman.

00:44:44.600 --> 00:44:50.020
We, the Jinwu Sect, don't want anyone to misunderstand us.

00:44:50.020 --> 00:44:51.780
We have nothing to do with the Japanese.

00:44:51.780 --> 00:44:56.460
Chen Zhen, you are a member of the Jinwu Sect.

00:44:56.460 --> 00:44:58.800
You shouldn't have any contact with this Japanese woman.

00:45:00.320 --> 00:45:04.630
Chen Zhen, did I come here to give you a lot of trouble?

00:45:04.630 --> 00:45:06.700
It's not that kind of thing.

00:45:06.700 --> 00:45:10.120
Chen Zhen, a big man can never change.

00:45:10.120 --> 00:45:14.510
Once the son and daughter have a long relationship, their heroism will be cut off.

00:45:14.510 --> 00:45:17.390
Could it be that you really ruined your life for a woman?

00:45:17.390 --> 00:45:21.410
Uncle Nong, Guang Zi abandoned everything and came here to find me.

00:45:21.410 --> 00:45:23.590
Moreover, what he said in court today,

00:45:23.590 --> 00:45:26.290
I can't not take care of him.

00:45:26.290 --> 00:45:30.000
Maybe this woman is just so casual.

00:45:31.280 --> 00:45:34.740
It's not easy for a Japanese to stay here in our Jingwu Gate.

00:45:34.740 --> 00:45:36.720
You make your own choice.

00:45:36.720 --> 00:45:39.530
Either you break up with this Japanese woman

00:45:39.530 --> 00:45:42.150
or you leave Jingwu Gate.

00:45:42.150 --> 00:45:45.370
Senior, are you really going to kick Senior Wu out?

00:45:45.370 --> 00:45:46.410
What's wrong, Liu Zhen Shan?

00:45:46.410 --> 00:45:48.450
You're standing on the Japanese side now.

00:45:48.450 --> 00:45:49.250
Don't wrong me.

00:45:49.250 --> 00:45:51.250
What wrong with you? You're becoming more and more like a radish.

00:45:51.250 --> 00:45:53.410
- Say it again. I'm more... - Say it again. You think I'm afraid of you?

00:45:53.410 --> 00:45:55.970
- No, don't! - Don't argue anymore!

00:45:55.970 --> 00:46:00.000
Chen Zhen, if you continue like this,

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:02.340
Jinwu Sect will collapse soon

00:46:02.340 --> 00:46:06.040
I don't want to see Jinwu Sect's internal conflict

00:46:06.040 --> 00:46:07.680
Now

00:46:07.680 --> 00:46:10.620
Our only way is you and me

00:46:10.620 --> 00:46:13.020
Let's see who will be the leader of Jinwu Sect first

00:46:13.020 --> 00:46:16.350
I never thought of being the leader

00:46:16.350 --> 00:46:17.350
I don't care if you have thought of it

00:46:17.350 --> 00:46:18.680
In fact

00:46:18.680 --> 00:46:20.890
There are many people in Jinwu Sect

00:46:20.890 --> 00:46:22.160
Just accept you or not

00:46:22.160 --> 00:46:24.030
I want to compete with you once

00:46:24.030 --> 00:46:25.270
I lost

00:46:25.270 --> 00:46:29.070
You are the leader of Jinwu Sect

00:46:29.070 --> 00:46:29.860
If you lose

00:46:30.410 --> 00:46:31.540
leave this place right now.

00:46:37.910 --> 00:46:38.610
Why?

00:48:03.000 --> 00:48:04.070
If you want to save the Japanese,

00:48:04.070 --> 00:48:05.700
come and save us.

00:49:00.860 --> 00:49:02.530
Go, go, go.

00:49:30.830 --> 00:49:32.090
You're not allowed to go in.

00:49:32.090 --> 00:49:33.700
You're not allowed to go in.

00:49:33.700 --> 00:49:34.740
You're not allowed to go in.

00:49:34.740 --> 00:49:45.000
You're not allowed to go in.

00:49:46.180 --> 00:49:47.820
You're good. You're good.

00:49:47.820 --> 00:49:48.760
Big brother, are you okay?

00:49:48.760 --> 00:49:51.210
Big brother. Big brother.

00:49:51.210 --> 00:49:54.550
I'm fine.

00:49:54.550 --> 00:49:58.160
I lost. You're the owner now.

00:49:58.160 --> 00:50:00.000
Big brother. Big brother.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:02.570
I will not leave Guang Zi.

00:50:02.570 --> 00:50:04.770
If you want me to choose,

00:50:04.770 --> 00:50:08.770
I will only leave Jinwu Sect.

00:51:03.550 --> 00:51:04.910
Prince, wait here for me.

00:51:10.150 --> 00:51:11.550
Do you have a room?

00:51:11.550 --> 00:51:13.350
Yes, I have a room.

00:51:13.350 --> 00:51:14.410
Please follow me.

00:51:14.410 --> 00:51:15.930
Do you have a room?

00:51:20.390 --> 00:51:21.370
Japanese?

00:51:21.370 --> 00:51:23.090
Japanese don't have a room?

00:51:23.090 --> 00:51:24.960
She is my wife.

00:51:24.960 --> 00:51:25.960
Please forgive her.

00:51:25.960 --> 00:51:26.960
Isn't that Chen Zhen?

00:51:26.960 --> 00:51:27.810
Where is our Chen Zhen?

00:51:27.810 --> 00:51:29.410
It turns out that she is a big traitor.

00:51:29.410 --> 00:51:30.000
Traitor.

00:51:30.600 --> 00:51:32.390
There is no room for you.

00:51:32.390 --> 00:51:36.280
You'd better leave now.

00:51:36.280 --> 00:51:37.720
Don't affect my business.

00:51:37.720 --> 00:51:39.040
Leave. Leave now.

00:51:39.040 --> 00:51:40.640
Chen Zhen, we'd better leave now.

00:51:40.640 --> 00:51:44.280
Hurry up and leave.

00:52:07.840 --> 00:52:09.640
What's wrong?

00:52:09.640 --> 00:52:13.060
There's a mouse.

00:52:13.060 --> 00:52:17.280
Where is it?

00:52:17.280 --> 00:52:20.020
There was a mouse here just now.

00:52:20.020 --> 00:52:27.200
Maybe it ran away.

00:52:27.200 --> 00:52:29.410
There must be a mouse in this kind of place.

00:52:35.530 --> 00:52:37.220
It's the mouse that came in first.

00:52:37.220 --> 00:52:39.890
In fact, we harassed it.

00:52:39.890 --> 00:52:40.770
I know.

00:52:40.770 --> 00:52:42.410
You're right.

00:52:44.190 --> 00:52:45.810
I'm really sorry for you.

00:52:45.810 --> 00:52:48.840
I asked you to live in this place.

00:52:48.840 --> 00:52:52.010
I think this place is very good.

00:52:52.010 --> 00:52:53.790
Look, the scenery is so beautiful.

00:52:53.790 --> 00:52:56.000
In fact, living here is much more comfortable than living in a hotel.

00:52:56.000 --> 00:52:57.320
You really think so?

00:52:57.320 --> 00:52:59.240
Then I'll take you to another place.

00:52:59.240 --> 00:53:00.000
You really want to

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:03.780
You forgot the Golden Wings?

00:53:03.780 --> 00:53:05.920
It's the Golden Wings who gave up on me.

00:53:05.920 --> 00:53:07.460
It's much easier to beat people

00:53:07.460 --> 00:53:08.820
without any protection.

00:53:08.820 --> 00:53:11.410
