00:53:16.540 --> 00:53:20.590
How can you feel relaxed?

00:53:20.590 --> 00:53:22.040
You know it now.

00:53:22.040 --> 00:53:26.750
Chen Zhen is lying to herself.

00:53:26.750 --> 00:53:29.510
You really know it?

00:53:41.840 --> 00:53:43.100
Mr. Long, please have some tea.

00:53:43.570 --> 00:53:44.370
Thank you.

00:53:45.420 --> 00:53:46.260
Why don't you eat?

00:53:47.140 --> 00:53:48.180
I don't have appetite.

00:53:49.170 --> 00:53:51.860
Ting'en hasn't come back yet.

00:53:54.050 --> 00:53:55.960
No wonder.

00:53:56.470 --> 00:53:58.490
Ting'en hasn't had any miscarriage since she was a child.

00:53:58.590 --> 00:53:59.960
She lost to Chen Zhen in the martial arts competition.

00:54:00.320 --> 00:54:01.890
It's hard to accept.

00:54:01.890 --> 00:54:03.490
Senior Brother is very stubborn.

00:54:03.490 --> 00:54:06.030
I'm afraid that he won't dare to be the master.

00:54:06.030 --> 00:54:08.430
If he doesn't become the master, who will become the master?

00:54:08.430 --> 00:54:11.730
The Mi Zong Quan of the Huo family has always been passed down from the outside.

00:54:11.730 --> 00:54:16.650
If he doesn't become the master, who will pass down the Mi Zong Quan?

00:54:16.650 --> 00:54:19.120
By the way, who is teaching Kung Fu these days?

00:54:19.120 --> 00:54:21.990
A'Qiang and A'Biao.

00:54:21.990 --> 00:54:24.980
If someone comes here to teach Kung Fu these days,

00:54:24.980 --> 00:54:28.240
then it will be good.

00:54:28.240 --> 00:54:29.670
My mother wrote a letter to tell me that

00:54:30.220 --> 00:54:32.240
that Jinwu Gate offended the Japanese

00:54:32.240 --> 00:54:36.190
and told me not to stay here.

00:54:36.190 --> 00:54:37.180
Then what should we do?

00:54:37.180 --> 00:54:39.510
Are you really leaving?

00:54:39.510 --> 00:54:40.510
I don't know what to do.

00:54:40.510 --> 00:54:41.650
Don't worry.

00:54:41.650 --> 00:54:43.510
Anyway, this is still a rented area.

00:54:43.510 --> 00:54:45.510
The Japanese will still be a little worried, right?

00:54:53.970 --> 00:54:56.150
You Chinese are such a waste.

00:54:56.150 --> 00:54:58.040
One table eats two tables of food.

00:55:00.280 --> 00:55:01.290
What is it?

00:55:01.290 --> 00:55:04.850
I want to see the owner of your Golden Tiger Sect.

00:55:04.850 --> 00:55:06.940
You can see the owner if you want to.

00:55:06.940 --> 00:55:08.380
What is it? Tell me.

00:55:08.380 --> 00:55:10.510
The first master of our Black Dragon Society,

00:55:10.510 --> 00:55:13.000
Master Chuan Yue,

00:55:13.000 --> 00:55:14.850
wants to challenge your owner.

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:31.020
I don't want to go back to my hometown.

00:55:31.020 --> 00:55:31.850
It's useless.

00:55:31.850 --> 00:55:32.730
Let's find Senior Wu.

00:55:32.730 --> 00:55:33.530
I know where he is.

00:55:33.530 --> 00:55:34.970
You want to go back to your hometown to fight?

00:55:34.970 --> 00:55:36.330
Don't talk nonsense here.

00:55:36.330 --> 00:55:37.210
Is he not?

00:55:37.210 --> 00:55:38.810
Stop fighting.

00:55:38.810 --> 00:55:40.660
You can't solve the problem if you keep fighting.

00:55:40.660 --> 00:55:42.620
Go and find your Senior Wu.

00:55:42.620 --> 00:55:43.460
Go.

00:55:43.460 --> 00:55:44.670
Go.

00:55:44.670 --> 00:55:49.020
Xiaohong.

00:55:49.020 --> 00:55:51.100
Aunt Lan, what's the matter?

00:55:51.100 --> 00:55:54.010
You came back so early.

00:55:55.610 --> 00:55:57.000
Xiaohong.

00:55:57.000 --> 00:55:59.540
We haven't talked for a long time.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:01.520
Come and sit in my room.

00:56:01.520 --> 00:56:03.600
Okay, I'll go and check on Ting.

00:56:06.560 --> 00:56:07.720
Mr. Huo has gone out.

00:56:07.720 --> 00:56:08.610
He has gone out?

00:56:08.610 --> 00:56:09.180
Yes.

00:56:09.180 --> 00:56:10.850
He told me that he would wait for me.

00:56:10.850 --> 00:56:14.650
Oh, he just went out.

00:56:14.650 --> 00:56:16.680
Okay, I'll go and sit in your room.

00:56:16.680 --> 00:56:18.310
Okay, come on.

00:56:21.810 --> 00:56:23.330
Xiao Hong.

00:56:33.580 --> 00:56:34.620
Why do you smoke?

00:56:36.600 --> 00:56:38.130
Mr. Huo wants to smoke.

00:56:38.340 --> 00:56:39.160
What do you care?

00:56:40.220 --> 00:56:40.850
Right?

00:56:41.320 --> 00:56:41.800
Get out.

00:56:41.800 --> 00:56:42.800
Mr. Huo.

00:56:43.080 --> 00:56:55.470
I want to smoke, not you.

00:56:55.470 --> 00:56:56.690
If you want to smoke,

00:56:57.240 --> 00:56:58.120
go outside and smoke.

00:56:58.120 --> 00:56:59.000
Don't smoke here.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.350
with Mr. Chou.

00:57:01.350 --> 00:57:04.420
I'll go back to hang the red card.

00:57:04.420 --> 00:57:23.910
Xiao Hong,

00:57:23.910 --> 00:57:25.640
what nonsense are you talking about?

00:57:25.640 --> 00:57:27.610
Mr. Huo loves you so much

00:57:27.610 --> 00:57:29.570
and spent so much money to support you.

00:57:30.160 --> 00:57:31.600
If Mr. Huo doesn't want to leave,

00:57:31.600 --> 00:57:32.790
no one can drive him away.

00:57:32.790 --> 00:57:33.990
All right, I'm fine.

00:57:33.990 --> 00:57:36.070
How can you treat Mr. Huo like this?

00:57:36.070 --> 00:57:37.200
You can go out first.

00:57:37.200 --> 00:57:41.120
Mr. Huo, I'll go out first.

00:57:41.120 --> 00:57:46.000
I'm sorry.

00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:48.080
I'm in a bad mood.

00:57:48.080 --> 00:57:50.170
So I want to talk to Mr. Huo.

00:57:50.170 --> 00:57:52.820
It's none of their business.

00:57:52.820 --> 00:57:54.800
If you don't want me to take revenge,

00:57:54.800 --> 00:57:56.050
I won't.

00:58:00.760 --> 00:58:02.780
I don't know what to do, Uncle Zeng.

00:58:02.780 --> 00:58:06.030
Don't pretend to be confused.

00:58:06.030 --> 00:58:06.950
What's wrong with me?

00:58:13.510 --> 00:58:15.750
Uncle Zeng, what are you doing here at this hour?

00:58:15.750 --> 00:58:20.930
I'm looking for you, Uncle Zeng.

00:58:20.930 --> 00:58:22.240
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:58:22.240 --> 00:58:23.240
I'm looking for you, Uncle Zeng.

00:58:23.240 --> 00:58:24.240
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:58:24.240 --> 00:58:27.110
I'm looking for you, Uncle Zeng.

00:58:27.110 --> 00:58:28.060
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:58:28.060 --> 00:58:29.270
I'm looking for you, Uncle Zeng.

00:58:29.270 --> 00:58:30.000
I'm looking for you, Uncle Zeng.

00:58:30.030 --> 00:58:33.070
Didn't you say I would let my son go after I gave him the medicine?

00:58:33.070 --> 00:58:35.910
Uncle Geng, your son committed a murder in Shandong.

00:58:35.910 --> 00:58:37.230
You can let him go if you want.

00:58:37.230 --> 00:58:39.170
You promised me.

00:58:39.170 --> 00:58:40.600
I didn't promise you.

00:58:40.600 --> 00:58:42.160
It was the radish head who promised me.

00:58:42.160 --> 00:58:44.040
My wife told me

00:58:44.040 --> 00:58:46.750
that my son killed the radish head in the prison.

00:58:46.750 --> 00:58:48.000
I'm telling you.

00:58:48.000 --> 00:58:49.680
You've already done what you said you wouldn't do.

00:58:49.680 --> 00:58:51.130
Besides, you didn't do it for nothing.

00:58:51.130 --> 00:58:53.190
You also took the sheep.

00:58:53.190 --> 00:58:55.100
How could you be soft-hearted when you took the money?

00:58:55.100 --> 00:58:57.120
Since the Japanese promised you,

00:58:57.120 --> 00:58:58.410
your son will definitely be fine.

00:58:58.410 --> 00:59:00.000
Don't talk nonsense anymore.

00:59:05.630 --> 00:59:08.480
You said the medicine wouldn't kill Master Huo.

00:59:08.480 --> 00:59:10.890
If I knew this earlier,

00:59:10.890 --> 00:59:13.120
I'd rather my son die than Master Huo.

00:59:30.320 --> 00:59:33.630
Hurry up! Help! Hurry up!

00:59:33.630 --> 00:59:47.650
Put the book down! Hurry up!

00:59:47.650 --> 00:59:49.670
What is this?

00:59:49.670 --> 00:59:54.030
This is the dried fish that Ting'er bought from Nanyang.

00:59:54.030 --> 00:59:56.060
It's for curing the dog's disease.

00:59:56.060 --> 00:59:58.030
Come here.

00:59:58.030 --> 01:00:00.000
Oh, right. There is only the old man's book in the door.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.360
to eat this thing.

01:00:01.360 --> 01:00:04.090
Oh, it seems that

01:00:04.090 --> 01:00:07.250
he poisoned Huo Yuanjia with crocodile meat.

01:00:07.250 --> 01:00:09.640
And now he killed himself.

01:00:10.970 --> 01:00:12.290
He's already dead.

01:00:12.290 --> 01:00:13.730
Don't tell this to others.

01:00:13.730 --> 01:00:14.530
It's not good to let them know

01:00:14.530 --> 01:00:16.890
that there is a spy in the Jinwu Gate.

01:00:16.890 --> 01:00:18.570
If there is a spy in the Jinwu Gate,

01:00:18.570 --> 01:00:19.750
it will be disbanded.

01:00:19.750 --> 01:00:21.100
Chen Zhen has left.

01:00:21.100 --> 01:00:23.050
Ting'en doesn't know where she's going.

01:00:23.050 --> 01:00:24.800
I think you should find someone

01:00:24.800 --> 01:00:27.600
to take care of the Jinwu Gate.

01:00:27.600 --> 01:00:29.600
The Jinwu Gate is like this.

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:32.400
I don't know how to explain it to Mr. Huo.

01:00:32.400 --> 01:00:33.340
Ask Mr. Huo.

01:00:36.180 --> 01:00:38.940
Mr. Huo, what should we do now?

01:00:38.940 --> 01:00:41.140
You lead the team today, you ask me?

01:00:41.140 --> 01:00:44.060
Please help me, Mr. Huo.

01:00:44.060 --> 01:00:45.620
Bring some fish meat to go back and check.

01:00:45.620 --> 01:00:46.350
Yes.

01:00:46.350 --> 01:00:48.040
We're going back, Captain.

01:00:48.040 --> 01:00:50.680
Please help me find Tianwen again.

01:00:50.680 --> 01:00:52.120
I know, don't worry.

01:01:15.100 --> 01:01:17.420
Miss, who are you looking for?

01:01:17.420 --> 01:01:21.160
Are Mr. Nong Jingsun and Mr. Nong here?

01:01:21.160 --> 01:01:26.940
Mr. Nong is inside. Please follow me.

01:01:26.940 --> 01:01:30.000
Mr. Nong, this girl

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.730
I want to see you.

01:01:31.730 --> 01:01:32.750
May I ask who you are?

01:01:32.750 --> 01:01:33.730
Uncle Long.

01:01:33.730 --> 01:01:35.130
Ting An is with me now.

01:01:35.130 --> 01:01:35.970
I tried to persuade her several times.

01:01:35.970 --> 01:01:37.130
She refused to come back.

01:01:37.130 --> 01:01:39.920
I think you are the only one who can persuade her now.

01:01:39.920 --> 01:01:40.600
Where do you live?

01:01:40.600 --> 01:01:45.050
Why didn't you take me there?

01:01:45.050 --> 01:01:46.260
Zui Xin House.

01:01:46.260 --> 01:01:47.090
That's a brothel.

01:02:04.640 --> 01:02:07.120
How long have you known Ting'en?

01:02:07.120 --> 01:02:09.090
Two years.

01:02:09.090 --> 01:02:18.270
He must have spent a lot of money on you.

01:02:18.270 --> 01:02:21.120
Don't worry.

01:02:21.120 --> 01:02:22.500
I will leave him.

01:02:22.500 --> 01:02:25.440
Uncle Long, don't misunderstand.

01:02:25.440 --> 01:02:27.720
Ting'en is not as bad as you think.

01:02:27.720 --> 01:02:30.000
In fact, he always

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:31.350
I hope to restore Jinwu Sect.

01:02:31.350 --> 01:02:32.660
He wants to tell me

01:02:32.660 --> 01:02:34.830
to do better than his father.

01:02:34.830 --> 01:02:37.430
It's true.

01:02:37.430 --> 01:02:39.570
Uncle Nong, you must help him.

01:03:00.410 --> 01:03:01.050
Brother Xu Ze.

01:03:02.000 --> 01:03:02.880
Don't come any closer.

01:03:04.500 --> 01:03:05.500
You want me to hit you?

01:03:06.260 --> 01:03:07.140
Let go of me.

01:03:08.230 --> 01:03:09.470
Let go of me.

01:03:09.470 --> 01:03:10.110
Don't go.

01:03:10.110 --> 01:03:11.390
Hurry up, don't go.

01:03:14.250 --> 01:03:16.320
Brother Xu.

01:03:30.990 --> 01:03:32.730
A'Xing, A'Biao, we're going back.

01:03:32.730 --> 01:03:34.370
Yes.

01:03:34.370 --> 01:03:36.160
You're all here.

01:03:36.160 --> 01:03:39.820
Is there something wrong with Golden Martial Arts School?

01:03:39.820 --> 01:03:41.990
Hongkou Daoshang challenged Golden Martial Arts School.

01:03:41.990 --> 01:03:45.460
We're going back to discuss it with you.

01:03:45.460 --> 01:03:47.540
What about Chen Zhen?

01:03:47.540 --> 01:03:50.020
He's not convinced.

01:03:50.020 --> 01:03:54.450
You're the owner of Golden Martial Arts School now.

01:03:54.450 --> 01:03:57.640
Alright, alright, forget it. Let's go.

01:03:57.640 --> 01:03:58.260
Wait.

01:04:02.010 --> 01:04:03.010
I'll go back with you

01:04:03.010 --> 01:04:08.200
Are you sure you'll win?

01:04:08.200 --> 01:04:11.360
Even if I lose

01:04:11.360 --> 01:04:13.730
I can't let Jinwu Gate be looked down upon

01:04:13.730 --> 01:04:23.650
Wait, what about this girl?

01:04:23.650 --> 01:04:30.000
Do you still want to leave her here?

01:04:30.440 --> 01:04:31.640
You are so unfair to her

01:04:31.640 --> 01:04:34.610
A'Long, call Lao Bao to come here

01:04:34.610 --> 01:04:35.370
Yes

01:04:35.370 --> 01:04:38.070
I want to give this girl a birth

01:04:38.800 --> 01:04:43.860
Xiao Hong

01:04:43.860 --> 01:04:46.310
Are you not going to wear those beautiful clothes in the future?

01:04:46.310 --> 01:04:47.580
Being able to be like you

01:04:47.580 --> 01:04:48.980
You don't know how happy I am

01:04:50.590 --> 01:04:53.150
This dress seems to be a bit narrow

01:04:53.150 --> 01:04:54.650
I will return another one to you tomorrow

01:04:54.650 --> 01:04:55.730
I have already checked

01:04:55.730 --> 01:04:56.610
Chuan Yue Wenfu

01:04:56.610 --> 01:04:58.340
He is the first master of the Black Dragon Society

01:04:58.340 --> 01:05:00.000
Also the first master in Japan

01:05:00.190 --> 01:05:01.240
But you don't have to be afraid.

01:05:01.240 --> 01:05:02.760
The child is not young anymore.

01:05:02.760 --> 01:05:04.870
Uncle Nong.

01:05:06.040 --> 01:05:10.110
Isn't that good?

01:05:10.110 --> 01:05:14.030
By the way,

01:05:14.030 --> 01:05:16.830
from now on, I will use your real name, Su Lan.

01:05:16.830 --> 01:05:17.800
Okay.

01:05:17.800 --> 01:05:19.320
If you can be so open to Guang Zi,

01:05:19.320 --> 01:05:21.220
that will be good.

01:05:21.220 --> 01:05:22.200
That's not the same.

01:05:22.200 --> 01:05:23.750
Guang Zi is Japanese.

01:05:23.750 --> 01:05:24.840
Ting,

01:05:24.840 --> 01:05:26.590
there will be a competition in ten days.

01:05:26.590 --> 01:05:28.060
You have to work harder.

01:05:28.060 --> 01:05:29.280
Okay.

01:05:44.040 --> 01:05:47.580
I'll take it over, hurry up.

01:05:47.580 --> 01:05:53.720
Today is really good.

01:05:53.720 --> 01:05:55.580
I treat everyone the same.

01:06:00.090 --> 01:06:01.570
Are you the best at martial arts?

01:06:03.250 --> 01:06:03.810
Yes.

01:06:05.210 --> 01:06:06.330
What about Chen Zhen?

01:06:08.970 --> 01:06:10.130
They are almost the same.

01:06:10.530 --> 01:06:11.570
Their martial arts are very good.

01:06:12.530 --> 01:06:19.350
Are you all right?

01:06:19.670 --> 01:06:20.600
Are you all right?

01:06:20.600 --> 01:06:21.200
I'm fine.

01:06:21.440 --> 01:06:23.000
Let's practice again.

01:06:23.280 --> 01:06:28.220
What's wrong with Senior?

01:06:28.540 --> 01:06:30.000
You look like you're out of your mind.

01:06:33.530 --> 01:06:44.800
It's so late, why don't you go to bed?

01:06:45.190 --> 01:06:46.070
You go first.

01:07:41.840 --> 01:07:47.190
Master Chuan Yue, I have already written a challenge letter for you to the Jinwu Sect.

01:07:47.190 --> 01:07:53.350
You need to figure out one thing.

01:07:53.350 --> 01:07:58.060
What is it that I, Chuan You Wenfu, want to do with someone?

01:07:58.060 --> 01:07:59.700
You don't need to worry about me.

01:08:00.090 --> 01:08:03.260
I want to remind you, the funds of the Black Dragon Society in China

01:08:03.260 --> 01:08:07.390
are all paid by us, the Army.

01:08:07.390 --> 01:08:11.100
It's fine.

01:08:11.100 --> 01:08:14.100
You can immediately stop your cooperation with the Black Dragon Society.

01:08:14.100 --> 01:08:18.440
I think that Chairman Tou Shanman will not agree.

01:08:18.440 --> 01:08:24.060
I'm telling you, don't use the Chairman's name to pressure me.

01:08:24.060 --> 01:08:29.220
I'm just a leader, not a scapegoat.

01:09:01.790 --> 01:09:05.040
- Hello. - Guang Zi, why do you live so far away?

01:09:05.040 --> 01:09:06.940
If I knew, I would have taken a human car.

01:09:06.940 --> 01:09:08.560
My father asked you to come?

01:09:08.560 --> 01:09:11.800
Your father is very busy. I haven't seen him for a long time.

01:09:11.800 --> 01:09:16.270
- Then why are you here? - It's for him.

01:09:16.270 --> 01:09:18.910
Chen Zhen?

01:09:18.910 --> 01:09:22.530
- Are you married? - No.

01:09:22.530 --> 01:09:24.600
Don't you live together?

01:09:24.600 --> 01:09:28.840
We want to get married, but the Chinese and the Japanese don't agree.

01:09:28.840 --> 01:09:30.000
It's good that you didn't get married.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:34.980
If she dies, you won't become a widow.

01:09:34.980 --> 01:09:37.000
What did you say?

01:09:37.000 --> 01:09:40.030
If you die, I'll send your ashes back to Japan.

01:09:40.030 --> 01:09:43.970
You're so confident.

01:09:43.970 --> 01:09:47.800
What? You want to compete?

01:09:47.800 --> 01:09:49.480
Chen Zhen, why didn't you tell me first?

01:09:49.480 --> 01:09:51.870
Men have a lot of things they won't tell women.

01:09:51.870 --> 01:09:55.350
Chen Zhen, come on.

01:10:06.140 --> 01:10:09.570
Young man, tell me, what is the strongest punch?

01:10:09.570 --> 01:10:21.440
It's when the power of the whole body is concentrated in one point and it is the strongest punch.

01:10:21.440 --> 01:10:24.320
Aiyo, you're pretty good at fighting.

01:10:24.320 --> 01:10:27.180
But I've never seen a stone be able to fight.

01:10:27.180 --> 01:10:28.860
You have to know that our opponent...

01:10:30.220 --> 01:10:35.050
Why don't you fight with me?

01:10:35.050 --> 01:10:38.450
What is the strongest defense?

01:10:38.450 --> 01:10:39.350
It's attack.

01:10:39.350 --> 01:10:41.120
Instead of using all your strength to defend,

01:10:41.120 --> 01:10:42.800
it's better to use all your strength to attack.

01:10:42.800 --> 01:10:44.730
In the shortest time, you can defeat your opponent.

01:10:44.730 --> 01:10:49.440
Oh, so your Huo-Jia-Quan is the same as Tang-Shou.

01:10:49.440 --> 01:10:51.040
It's the boxing technique of Chi-Gang.

01:10:51.040 --> 01:10:52.880
Do you understand boxing technique?

01:10:52.880 --> 01:10:55.510
If you lack strength, you're wasting your strength.

01:10:55.510 --> 01:10:57.120
If you lack strength, you're not being able to attack.

01:10:57.120 --> 01:10:58.940
If you lack clothes, you're not being able to fight.

01:10:58.940 --> 01:11:00.000
If you lack money, you're not being able to fight.

01:11:00.860 --> 01:11:03.140
Old master, how did you teach your disciple?

01:11:03.140 --> 01:11:07.470
Fighting is the most important skill.

01:11:07.470 --> 01:11:09.530
You must be confident.

01:11:09.530 --> 01:11:12.760
Your master should have taught you these basic principles.

01:11:12.760 --> 01:11:14.940
My master doesn't talk so much.

01:11:14.940 --> 01:11:18.500
Are you going to fight or not?

01:11:52.200 --> 01:11:54.070
My old man needs to warm up first.

01:13:00.890 --> 01:13:03.690
Yes.

01:13:03.690 --> 01:13:13.730
Nonsense. It's good to win.

01:13:31.280 --> 01:13:34.340
I'll kill you with my own two hands.

01:13:35.340 --> 01:13:37.270
I'll kill you with my own two hands.

01:13:37.270 --> 01:13:39.440
I'll kill you with my own two hands.

01:13:39.440 --> 01:13:40.440
I'll kill you with my own two hands.

01:13:40.440 --> 01:13:43.920
I'll kill you with my own two hands.

01:14:35.530 --> 01:14:37.100
Are your eyes okay?

01:14:37.100 --> 01:14:39.610
No problem.

01:14:39.610 --> 01:14:41.270
I won't take advantage of you.

01:17:20.670 --> 01:17:24.150
It's rare for an old man to have such skill.

01:17:24.150 --> 01:17:27.910
It's also rare for an old man to have such strength.

01:17:27.910 --> 01:17:29.250
Don't be polite.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:32.800
The Chinese have a saying, "All are afraid of fire"

01:17:32.800 --> 01:17:34.060
It's a wise saying

01:17:34.060 --> 01:17:35.820
Mr. Chanyu, you win first

01:17:35.820 --> 01:17:38.900
You have to remember it

01:17:38.900 --> 01:17:40.960
But I still lost

01:17:40.960 --> 01:17:43.810
I just used your boxing technique

01:17:43.810 --> 01:17:47.570
Chinese martial arts emphasize personal cultivation

01:17:47.570 --> 01:17:49.630
And don't pay attention to actual combat

01:17:49.630 --> 01:17:51.150
You have such a performance today

01:17:51.150 --> 01:17:52.430
It can be said to be a breakthrough

01:17:52.430 --> 01:17:55.330
The ultimate goal is to knock down the other person

01:17:55.330 --> 01:17:56.880
You are completely wrong

01:17:56.880 --> 01:17:59.230
Young man, let me tell you

01:17:59.230 --> 01:18:00.000
To knock down

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:02.310
The best way is to use a handgun.

01:18:02.310 --> 01:18:05.800
The goal of martial arts

01:18:05.800 --> 01:18:08.900
is to push a person's physical ability to the highest limit.

01:18:08.900 --> 01:18:11.800
If you want to reach this level,

01:18:11.800 --> 01:18:14.600
you must understand the universe.

01:18:14.600 --> 01:18:16.790
Okay, I'm leaving.

01:18:16.790 --> 01:18:20.670
Aren't you going to have a duel?

01:18:20.670 --> 01:18:23.600
No need to compare.

01:18:23.600 --> 01:18:25.320
We've already had a duel.

01:18:25.320 --> 01:18:26.920
It's a tie.

01:18:30.000 --> 01:18:32.180
But I don't represent all the Japanese

01:18:32.180 --> 01:18:36.210
There are still many people in Japan who are better at martial arts than I am

01:18:36.210 --> 01:18:39.000
Master Chuan Yue, aren't you the best in Japan?

01:18:39.000 --> 01:18:41.330
Master Chuan Yue's martial arts is the best

01:18:41.330 --> 01:18:43.160
It's his martial arts cultivation

01:18:43.160 --> 01:18:45.970
Not his killing skills

01:18:45.970 --> 01:18:48.980
Huo Yuanjia, I lost

01:18:48.980 --> 01:18:52.400
I didn't expect you to have such a good disciple

01:18:52.400 --> 01:18:59.380
Now the best master at Hongkou Daochang

01:19:00.030 --> 01:19:03.670
It's Teng Tiangang who is called a robot.

01:19:03.670 --> 01:19:17.550
Young man, take care of yourself.

01:19:23.650 --> 01:19:28.400
Why did I put the chess here?

01:19:28.400 --> 01:19:30.000
Chuyue.

01:19:30.280 --> 01:19:35.180
Aren't you worried at all?

01:19:35.180 --> 01:19:37.010
Worry about what?

01:19:37.010 --> 01:19:39.890
You don't want to go back to Japan.

01:19:39.890 --> 01:19:41.960
Have you ever thought about it?

01:19:41.960 --> 01:19:45.700
The position of the head of the Black Dragon Club may not be safe.

01:19:45.700 --> 01:19:47.770
It's not a pity.

01:19:47.770 --> 01:19:53.610
It's much better than being a chess player in the army.

01:19:53.610 --> 01:19:55.720
Now you've lost.

01:19:59.730 --> 01:20:00.000
It's okay.

01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:03.740
I didn't expect you to make so much progress in your chess game.

01:20:03.740 --> 01:20:09.630
It's a pity that life is not as easy as the chess game.

01:20:09.630 --> 01:20:11.470
I remember a few years ago,

01:20:11.470 --> 01:20:15.970
Mr. Sun Yixin was the best friend of our Black Dragon Society.

01:20:15.970 --> 01:20:18.350
Today's Black Dragon Society has also changed.

01:20:18.350 --> 01:20:25.500
Just like the army, they want to take over China.

01:20:25.500 --> 01:20:30.000
Want to take over China?

01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:31.690
I know what you're talking about

01:20:31.690 --> 01:20:33.490
but Japan's current situation

01:20:33.490 --> 01:20:36.090
is like a very strong ant

01:20:36.090 --> 01:20:38.540
that wants to eat an elephant in surgery

01:20:38.540 --> 01:20:41.140
When the elephant doesn't wake up

01:20:41.140 --> 01:20:44.730
that ant seems to be a bit sweet

01:20:44.730 --> 01:20:46.370
But if the elephant wakes up

01:20:46.370 --> 01:20:48.720
no matter how strong the ant is

01:20:48.720 --> 01:20:51.450
it won't be able to make it out

01:20:51.450 --> 01:20:52.930
Even if it doesn't wake up

01:20:52.930 --> 01:20:54.230
the elephant won't be able to make it out

01:20:54.230 --> 01:20:55.710
If the elephant doesn't wake up

01:20:55.710 --> 01:20:58.000
the elephant won't be able to make it out

01:20:58.000 --> 01:21:00.000
The elephant won't be able to make it out

01:21:00.030 --> 01:21:01.220
I don't think there is a possibility of winning.

01:21:01.220 --> 01:21:03.620
But I think

01:21:03.620 --> 01:21:07.240
this stupid elephant hasn't woken up yet.

01:21:07.240 --> 01:21:11.400
And there is more than one ant that wants to eat it.

01:21:11.400 --> 01:21:13.060
It will wake up eventually.

01:21:13.060 --> 01:21:19.700
That's right.

01:21:19.700 --> 01:21:21.670
It's a pity

01:21:21.670 --> 01:21:24.870
that most of the Japanese people don't believe you now.

01:21:24.870 --> 01:21:26.730
In the past ten years,

01:21:26.730 --> 01:21:28.500
the results of every war in Japan

01:21:28.500 --> 01:21:30.000
have gained great benefits.

01:21:31.400 --> 01:21:33.240
Japan wants to become a great empire

01:21:33.240 --> 01:21:36.870
There are too many people like General Teng

01:21:36.870 --> 01:21:40.310
in Japan

01:21:40.310 --> 01:21:43.410
Judging from this situation

01:21:43.410 --> 01:21:46.230
this war is really inevitable

01:22:16.700 --> 01:22:19.940
Is Chenchen here?

01:22:19.940 --> 01:22:21.220
She hasn't come back yet.

01:22:21.220 --> 01:22:27.040
Please sit down.

01:22:45.680 --> 01:22:46.580
Please have some tea.

01:22:46.580 --> 01:22:56.880
Who did you learn Chinese from?

01:22:56.880 --> 01:22:59.570
I learned it from Chen Zhen.

01:23:02.750 --> 01:23:04.090
Well said.

01:23:04.090 --> 01:23:10.030
You're back.

01:23:10.030 --> 01:23:11.270
Mr. Huo is looking for you.

01:23:11.270 --> 01:23:28.620
How have you been?

01:23:28.620 --> 01:23:29.640
What are you busy with?

01:23:30.800 --> 01:23:32.680
I found a job at the telecommunications bureau.

01:23:34.060 --> 01:23:35.290
You really gave up on Golden Wu Gate?

01:23:35.290 --> 01:23:36.530
It doesn't matter if I give up or not.

01:23:37.040 --> 01:23:38.360
Without Golden Wu Gate,

01:23:39.220 --> 01:23:41.880
my job is still very meaningful.

01:23:43.450 --> 01:23:45.170
Golden Wu Gate still needs you to come back.

01:23:47.780 --> 01:23:55.400
I also brought Xiao Hong back.

01:23:55.920 --> 01:23:57.330
The one in the new building.

01:23:58.440 --> 01:24:00.000
You haven't seen her yet?

01:24:01.020 --> 01:24:01.980
Congratulations.

01:24:01.980 --> 01:24:05.330
You can also bring Guang Zi back to the Jinwu sect.

01:24:05.330 --> 01:24:09.290
They can accept Xiao Hong.

01:24:09.290 --> 01:24:11.480
They won't accept Guang Zi.

01:24:11.480 --> 01:24:13.790
Because he is Japanese.

01:24:13.790 --> 01:24:16.240
Guang Zi can sacrifice for you like this.

01:24:16.240 --> 01:24:17.350
She is a good girl.

01:24:17.350 --> 01:24:21.300
I don't know what other people will think.

01:24:21.300 --> 01:24:23.290
If she stays in the Jinwu sect,

01:24:23.290 --> 01:24:25.150
it will definitely affect the reputation of the Jinwu sect.

01:24:25.150 --> 01:24:27.470
I can't be so selfish.

01:24:27.470 --> 01:24:30.000
I learned a new set of money recently.

01:24:31.240 --> 01:24:32.850
I'll teach you.

01:25:10.170 --> 01:25:13.360
This fist is very similar to the Huo family's fist.

01:25:13.360 --> 01:25:14.810
It is the Huo family's Mizong fist.

01:25:14.810 --> 01:25:15.710
But master said that

01:25:15.710 --> 01:25:17.660
the Mizong fist doesn't have an external nature.

01:25:17.660 --> 01:25:20.190
The Mizong fist is just a fist.

01:25:20.190 --> 01:25:22.650
The difference is created by my father.

01:25:22.650 --> 01:25:25.160
Chen Zhen, please promise me

01:25:25.160 --> 01:25:27.220
that I will go to the Red Pagoda for a duel tomorrow.

01:25:27.220 --> 01:25:28.760
If I have any problems,

01:25:28.760 --> 01:25:30.000
just pass this fist down to me.

01:25:30.670 --> 01:25:31.890
The more people learn, the better.

01:25:31.890 --> 01:25:57.130
I'm sorry.

01:25:57.130 --> 01:25:59.800
I finally decided to leave.

01:26:00.600 --> 01:26:03.510
Some things in life are more important than love.

01:26:03.510 --> 01:26:05.450
Without me by your side,

01:26:05.450 --> 01:26:08.320
there are so many things you can do.

01:26:08.320 --> 01:26:09.940
Keep your promise.

01:26:09.940 --> 01:26:12.700
When the Japanese army returns to Japan,

01:26:12.700 --> 01:26:14.630
I will wait for you in the capital.

01:26:30.960 --> 01:26:31.440
Let's go.

01:27:09.820 --> 01:27:11.040
I can go with Alan.

01:27:11.760 --> 01:27:14.310
Ting'en, I'm afraid something will happen.

01:27:14.450 --> 01:27:16.320
Do you want me to find a few more people to help you?

01:27:16.610 --> 01:27:17.920
Nothing will happen.

01:27:18.210 --> 01:27:19.090
If there are too many people,

01:27:19.090 --> 01:27:20.610
the Japanese will think we are afraid of them.

01:27:21.030 --> 01:27:23.620
Yes, wait for me to come back.

01:27:25.280 --> 01:27:28.230
Xiao Hui, please take care of Xiao Hong.

01:27:31.080 --> 01:27:33.860
I'm leaving.

01:27:33.860 --> 01:27:39.100
Tianyuan.

01:27:39.100 --> 01:27:40.980
I know Japanese.

01:27:40.980 --> 01:27:42.800
I'll go with you.

01:27:42.800 --> 01:27:53.120
If they go together,

01:27:53.120 --> 01:27:54.640
there won't be any problems.

01:27:54.640 --> 01:27:57.070
Sir, the traveler, Wenfu,

01:27:57.070 --> 01:27:58.700
left Shanghai this morning.

01:27:58.700 --> 01:28:00.000
It's a long story.

01:28:00.030 --> 01:28:02.900
He doesn't want to cooperate with the Imperial Army

01:28:02.900 --> 01:28:04.360
He is the enemy of the Imperial Army

01:28:04.360 --> 01:28:06.690
Send the message to Dongjing

01:28:06.690 --> 01:28:07.460
Yes

01:28:07.460 --> 01:28:10.370
Chief

01:28:10.370 --> 01:28:13.030
Are you going to cancel the deal with Jingwen?

01:28:13.030 --> 01:28:13.990
No need

01:28:13.990 --> 01:28:16.610
I have to rely on the Black Dragon Society for everything

01:28:16.610 --> 01:28:20.130
This time I will solve it myself

01:28:20.130 --> 01:28:21.440
Yes

01:28:42.440 --> 01:28:46.610
It's great that you two are here together.

01:28:46.610 --> 01:28:49.400
Mr. Huo, I have good news to tell you.

01:28:49.400 --> 01:28:51.720
I have found the murderer who killed your father.

01:29:06.590 --> 01:29:08.750
This person was bribed

01:29:08.750 --> 01:29:11.590
and poisoned the fish meat bought by Mr. Huo.

01:29:11.590 --> 01:29:20.160
He betrayed his master.

01:29:20.160 --> 01:29:28.250
Get out.

01:29:28.250 --> 01:29:28.900
Yes.

01:29:32.590 --> 01:29:34.230
Without my order, you are not allowed to enter.

01:29:34.230 --> 01:29:36.600
Yes, you are not allowed to go out.

01:29:36.600 --> 01:29:48.600
If you lose, I will give you this pie.

01:29:48.600 --> 01:29:50.160
This is my own blood.

01:30:31.080 --> 01:30:31.860
Take this!

01:32:01.400 --> 01:32:20.130
I've been waiting for this moment for a long time...

01:32:20.130 --> 01:32:22.660
I've been waiting for this moment for a long time...

01:32:22.660 --> 01:32:28.770
I've been waiting for this moment for a long time...

01:34:30.250 --> 01:34:30.800
*crash*

01:38:35.050 --> 01:38:35.510
Thank you.

01:40:22.330 --> 01:40:23.010
Are you okay?

01:40:30.860 --> 01:40:33.900
Right now I'm not an official, I'm telling you, I'm a Chinese!

01:40:33.900 --> 01:40:36.630
No matter what happens, I must take Chen Zhen and Huo Ting away!

01:40:36.630 --> 01:40:37.590
Don't even think about it!

01:40:37.590 --> 01:40:40.130
Do you think you can safely leave this place?

01:40:40.130 --> 01:40:45.530
I think you won't even know how you're going to die later!

01:40:45.530 --> 01:40:48.660
Stop it!

01:40:48.660 --> 01:40:52.100
You're not allowed to open the boxes!

01:40:52.100 --> 01:40:57.780
I think this matter must be resolved in a peaceful manner!

01:40:57.780 --> 01:41:00.000
Teng Tian is dead!

01:41:01.150 --> 01:41:03.840
It's not worthy to sacrifice more lives for this man.

01:41:03.840 --> 01:41:05.240
Comrades!

01:41:05.240 --> 01:41:06.100
Yes!

01:41:06.100 --> 01:41:08.480
Take your troops and leave this place immediately!

01:41:08.480 --> 01:41:10.840
Commander!

01:41:10.840 --> 01:41:14.620
Comrades, I am the highest commander here.

01:41:14.620 --> 01:41:16.870
Do you really dare to defy your fate?

01:41:16.870 --> 01:41:18.500
Yes!

01:41:18.500 --> 01:41:19.300
Comrades!

01:41:19.300 --> 01:41:20.390
Retreat!

01:41:30.600 --> 01:41:35.160
Mr. Shi, a Japanese soldier is dying now.

01:41:35.160 --> 01:41:38.240
I want the murderer to be told by the government.

01:41:38.240 --> 01:41:44.540
If there is no one, the Japanese army will not give up.

01:41:44.540 --> 01:41:47.480
You mean, if I didn't die,

01:41:47.480 --> 01:41:50.560
the army will use this opportunity to start the war?

01:41:50.560 --> 01:41:53.120
Yes.

01:41:53.120 --> 01:41:58.710
Okay, then sacrifice me alone.

01:42:03.710 --> 01:42:07.140
Yes, not bad.

01:42:07.140 --> 01:42:08.960
He is a man.

01:43:00.830 --> 01:43:01.930
I'm not giving in.

01:43:01.930 --> 01:43:03.310
The Japanese and the British

01:43:03.310 --> 01:43:04.850
are just a bunch of snakes.

01:43:04.850 --> 01:43:06.130
They can't get their hands on it.

01:43:06.130 --> 01:43:08.330
But the Chinese don't know anything about it.

01:43:08.330 --> 01:43:10.590
The Chinese don't know anything about it.

01:43:10.590 --> 01:43:11.880
Chen Zhen

01:43:11.880 --> 01:43:13.540
is really a great hero.

01:43:14.660 --> 01:43:15.950
With just a few punches,

01:43:15.950 --> 01:43:18.790
he beat Hongkou Taoist temple to the ground.

01:43:18.790 --> 01:43:20.430
He's really amazing.

01:43:22.640 --> 01:43:24.400
It's a pity that he died too early.

01:43:24.400 --> 01:43:25.440
That's right.

01:43:29.350 --> 01:43:30.000
Uncle.

01:43:30.030 --> 01:43:31.270
- What is it? - It's nothing.

01:43:31.270 --> 01:43:32.530
Let's continue talking.

01:43:33.240 --> 01:43:34.610
I got it.

01:43:34.610 --> 01:43:40.820
I didn't expect Xiang to be a spy.

01:43:40.820 --> 01:43:42.260
We used to treat him so well.

01:43:42.260 --> 01:43:43.890
This time, he is the fourth ghost of Wu Shixiong.

01:43:43.890 --> 01:43:45.140
He did a good thing.

01:43:45.140 --> 01:43:51.410
Wu Shixiong, where are we going now?

01:43:51.410 --> 01:43:53.680
Where do you think the Japanese are the most famous in China?

01:43:53.680 --> 01:43:54.800
Dongsan Province.

01:43:54.800 --> 01:43:57.680
Then let's go to Dongsan Province to talk about bandits.
